WEBVTT

01:31.264 --> 01:33.908
[Episode 25]

02:24.039 --> 02:25.580
It's the same taste

02:27.840 --> 02:29.819
as it was 20 years ago.

02:41.680 --> 02:43.759
Ling Yun Fei,

02:43.759 --> 02:45.620
are you going to confess or not?

03:03.312 --> 03:04.908
All my life,

03:05.688 --> 03:07.460
I hate informers the most.

03:13.319 --> 03:14.819
Execute!

03:16.080 --> 03:27.560
Execute him!

03:28.280 --> 03:31.960
Great!

03:31.960 --> 03:33.580
Well done!

03:37.319 --> 03:39.199
The traitor has been executed.

03:39.199 --> 03:41.219
We may report to His Majesty.

03:45.360 --> 03:47.592
Meng Ting Hui fulfilled her pledge on time.

03:47.592 --> 03:48.984
She's eradicated the Huxiao Gang.

03:48.984 --> 03:50.080
She lived up to my expectations.

03:50.080 --> 03:53.379
The rest will be handled as you said.

03:54.120 --> 03:55.840
Yes, Your Majesty.

03:55.840 --> 03:57.000
Shen Zhi Shu.

03:57.000 --> 03:58.500
Yes.

03:59.960 --> 04:01.384
You have made great contributions

04:01.384 --> 04:03.879
in arresting the Huxiao Gang
and investigating the Blood Moon Society,

04:03.879 --> 04:06.400
so I specially promote you
to the fourth-rank Supervisory Censor.

04:06.400 --> 04:07.800
You will
handle the entire Blood Moon Society case.

04:07.800 --> 04:09.360
In addition, I'll transfer you to the border

04:09.360 --> 04:10.639
to reinforce Qingzhou's defenses.

04:10.639 --> 04:14.900
If you get solid evidence of treason,
you may act first and report later.

04:17.920 --> 04:19.160
Thank you, Your Majesty.

04:19.160 --> 04:20.560
I will surely give my all to it

04:20.560 --> 04:22.000
and live up to Your Majesty's expectations.

04:22.000 --> 04:23.500
Rise.

04:24.680 --> 04:25.879
Your Majesty,

04:25.879 --> 04:26.920
I have found out

04:26.920 --> 04:28.480
that the Blood Moon Society was created
by the remnants of Zhongwan.

04:28.480 --> 04:29.519
Under the cover of Huiyin House,

04:29.519 --> 04:30.759
they've been lurking
in the capital for many years,

04:30.759 --> 04:32.560
winning over many high officials and nobles.

04:32.560 --> 04:34.879
Its ambition to restore their nation
is obvious.

04:34.879 --> 04:36.600
We are now doing our utmost
to arrest the remaining members.

04:36.600 --> 04:38.144
Your Majesty,

04:38.144 --> 04:40.680
I once followed the late emperor
to conquer Zhongwan.

04:40.680 --> 04:43.680
Please allow me to lead elite troops

04:43.680 --> 04:45.360
to eradicate the remnants of Zhongwan.

04:45.360 --> 04:49.480
At my age,
if I could die in battle for our country,

04:49.480 --> 04:51.079
I would feel proud of it.

04:51.079 --> 04:54.600
Ruthless suppression
will only breed more hatred.

04:54.600 --> 04:57.360
Moreover, Qingzhou borders Beijian.

04:57.360 --> 04:59.480
In both internal and external crises,

04:59.480 --> 05:01.879
the people will suffer.

05:01.879 --> 05:03.439
Your Majesty is far-sighted.

05:03.439 --> 05:04.920
According to my investigation,

05:04.920 --> 05:06.352
Beijian once wanted

05:06.352 --> 05:08.560
to jointly mine the Wanshan iron ore
at the border of Qingzhou.

05:08.560 --> 05:11.579
If they collude with the Blood Moon Society,
it could cause great disaster.

05:16.519 --> 05:18.360
Your Majesty,

05:18.360 --> 05:19.480
I have an idea.

05:19.480 --> 05:22.699
Without the use of force,
we can eliminate the external threat.

05:30.240 --> 05:31.648
Your Majesty,

05:31.648 --> 05:33.079
Beijian has proposed marriage,

05:33.079 --> 05:34.759
willing to let their goddess marry you.

05:34.759 --> 05:37.360
Their goddess is versed in astrology

05:37.360 --> 05:38.560
and can also tell fortunes of the nation.

05:38.560 --> 05:40.240
Her status is noble.

05:40.240 --> 05:43.079
If Your Majesty marries her, the relationship
between the two countries will stay strong.

05:43.079 --> 05:45.160
Though the Blood Moon Society
has wild ambitions,

05:45.160 --> 05:47.360
it will be difficult for them
to stir up things with the help of Beijian.

05:47.360 --> 05:49.296
Absurd!

05:49.296 --> 05:51.360
How can a foreign woman

05:51.360 --> 05:53.079
be the empress of our country?

05:53.079 --> 05:55.279
Beijian is deploying troops on the border

05:55.279 --> 05:57.000
while sending envoys for a marriage alliance.

05:57.000 --> 06:00.040
Is this their sincerity or a threat?

06:00.040 --> 06:01.319
Your Majesty,

06:01.319 --> 06:04.000
if a marriage alliance can
bring ten years of peace to the border,

06:04.000 --> 06:05.639
it might be a good idea.

06:05.639 --> 06:08.560
We have built a trade alliance with Beijian.

06:08.560 --> 06:11.079
Why do we need a marriage alliance
to seek peace?

06:11.079 --> 06:14.560
Good relations between two countries
rely on strength.

06:14.560 --> 06:16.279
Your Majesty is absolutely right.

06:16.279 --> 06:20.079
Ministers will recommend the right person
to be the empress.

06:20.079 --> 06:22.399
Now the position of the empress
has been vacant for a long time,

06:22.399 --> 06:24.199
which has aroused Beijian's covetousness.

06:24.199 --> 06:28.319
I beg Your Majesty
to appoint an empress as soon as possible

06:28.319 --> 06:30.600
to end those barbarians' wishful thinking.

06:30.600 --> 06:33.224
Beijian has already sent envoys
for a marriage alliance.

06:33.224 --> 06:36.040
If not handled properly,
it may cause border conflicts.

06:36.040 --> 06:37.832
You two, stop arguing.

06:37.832 --> 06:40.319
I will carefully consider it myself.

06:40.319 --> 06:41.819
Meng Ting Hui.

06:44.680 --> 06:47.080
I have one more comment

06:47.080 --> 06:48.752
for the memorial you just submitted.

06:48.752 --> 06:51.860
Take a look
and see if there is anything unclear.

06:58.279 --> 06:59.759
<i>Beijian wants a marriage alliance,</i>

06:59.759 --> 07:02.639
<i>but I don't want it.</i>

07:02.639 --> 07:04.699
<i>What I want is only you.</i>

07:07.120 --> 07:09.160
Your Majesty,

07:09.160 --> 07:10.639
I understand.

07:10.639 --> 07:12.512
- Your Majesty.
- Enough.

07:12.512 --> 07:14.680
All of you may leave.

07:14.680 --> 07:16.880
Meng Ting Hui, you stay.

07:16.880 --> 07:19.180
We take our leave.

07:44.872 --> 07:46.899
- Just now--
- Your Majesty.

07:48.760 --> 07:52.480
Your Majesty,
I have an urgent matter to report.

07:52.480 --> 07:53.839
What is it?

07:53.839 --> 07:56.592
Your Majesty has been on the throne
for three years and has not yet married.

07:56.592 --> 07:58.800
Your marriage is a major state affair,

07:58.800 --> 08:00.000
the foundation of the nation.

08:00.000 --> 08:02.399
Your Majesty,
if you do not wish for a marriage alliance,

08:02.399 --> 08:04.160
I can

08:04.160 --> 08:06.879
select a few talented, beautiful ladies
for Your Majesty.

08:06.879 --> 08:08.600
You want me to run away from the palace?

08:08.600 --> 08:09.879
No, I don't.

08:09.879 --> 08:11.519
Just leave.

08:11.519 --> 08:13.139
I'll take my leave.

08:23.240 --> 08:26.524
Were you angry just now? Were you jealous?

08:27.872 --> 08:29.432
Of course not.

08:29.432 --> 08:31.839
Your Majesty is the ruler of a nation.

08:31.839 --> 08:34.376
If I'm jealous of every woman,

08:34.376 --> 08:35.908
I will overstep my bounds.

08:41.039 --> 08:42.740
Indeed,

08:43.768 --> 08:45.340
but I'm happy if you are.

08:49.759 --> 08:51.259
Your Majesty.

08:53.679 --> 08:54.799
Your Majesty.

08:54.799 --> 08:56.299
What are you afraid of?

08:57.040 --> 09:00.919
Where is the courage
you had in Wangxian Valley?

09:00.919 --> 09:02.419
Your Majesty.

09:07.960 --> 09:09.820
Please restrain yourself.

09:34.464 --> 09:36.039
[Shen Mansion]

09:36.039 --> 09:37.120
Zhi Li.

09:37.120 --> 09:38.720
I am going to Qingzhou on business,

09:38.720 --> 09:39.872
not being exiled to the far north.

09:39.872 --> 09:42.580
People will laugh at me
for packing so many things.

09:43.360 --> 09:45.120
Qingzhou is bitterly cold.

09:45.120 --> 09:47.512
It's even frosty in June.

09:47.512 --> 09:51.904
Zhi Shu, you care more about appearance
than warmth.

09:51.904 --> 09:53.559
But you're away for official business,

09:53.559 --> 09:55.639
so put aside your appearance for now.

09:55.639 --> 09:57.480
Taking care of your health
is the most important thing.

09:57.480 --> 10:00.759
You are so thoughtful,
as if you were my big sister.

10:00.759 --> 10:01.799
Good idea.

10:01.799 --> 10:04.312
From now on, I can be your big sister.

10:04.312 --> 10:06.700
Please. Your little brother is only Nian.

10:07.696 --> 10:09.848
I don't dare to compete with him.

10:09.848 --> 10:11.080
Don't take it out again.

10:11.080 --> 10:12.720
I'll go see if Father is done cooking.

10:12.720 --> 10:14.220
I'll call you later.

10:20.840 --> 10:22.348
Zhi Shu.

10:23.320 --> 10:24.912
Listen to me.

10:24.912 --> 10:26.799
The border is not as safe as the capital.

10:26.799 --> 10:28.279
When you're alone outside,

10:28.279 --> 10:30.512
you can't be too careful.

10:30.512 --> 10:33.179
So I specially prepared this for you.

10:34.712 --> 10:36.340
Be sure to wear it at all times.

10:38.376 --> 10:40.784
Alright, put it in.

10:40.784 --> 10:42.440
I know you too well.

10:42.440 --> 10:43.896
You readily take it,

10:43.896 --> 10:45.736
but then forget about it.

10:45.736 --> 10:48.779
Today, I must personally put it on you.

10:49.480 --> 10:51.600
Don't get handsy.

10:51.600 --> 10:53.480
I'm already spoken for.

10:53.480 --> 10:55.768
I must remain pure for Fu Zhi.

10:55.768 --> 10:57.960
Sure, you're spoken for

10:57.960 --> 10:59.928
and should remain pure.

10:59.928 --> 11:01.428
I'll leave it here.

11:02.496 --> 11:04.392
Nian.

11:04.392 --> 11:06.019
Before I leave,

11:07.520 --> 11:09.259
I want to entrust you with some things.

11:11.208 --> 11:13.840
I don't know when I will return.

11:13.840 --> 11:17.080
What worries me most is our family.

11:17.080 --> 11:18.800
Father and Mother are getting old.

11:18.800 --> 11:20.360
Zhi Li is still unmarried.

11:20.360 --> 11:21.879
You must take good care of them,

11:21.879 --> 11:23.528
especially Zhi Li.

11:23.528 --> 11:26.879
Don't worry, Zhi Shu.
I will definitely protect her.

11:26.879 --> 11:28.559
Just protection is not enough.

11:28.559 --> 11:31.840
I've long known how you feel about Zhi Li.

11:31.840 --> 11:32.879
I...

11:32.879 --> 11:35.259
There's no need to hide it from me.

11:41.288 --> 11:43.159
Zhi Li grew up with you.

11:43.159 --> 11:44.759
I'm her own brother,

11:44.759 --> 11:47.240
but she cares more about you than me.

11:47.240 --> 11:48.360
I also know

11:48.360 --> 11:49.919
that you are not simple.

11:49.919 --> 11:52.259
You've had designs on Zhi Li from the start.

11:53.639 --> 11:55.680
However,

11:55.680 --> 11:57.340
I'm relieved

11:58.760 --> 12:00.316
to entrust Zhi Li to you.

12:07.464 --> 12:10.336
I did reveal my feelings to her,

12:10.336 --> 12:11.679
but in her heart...

12:11.679 --> 12:13.000
Don't worry.

12:13.000 --> 12:14.360
Between her and Lord Gu,

12:14.360 --> 12:18.080
there is nothing but the admiration
of a student for a teacher,

12:18.080 --> 12:20.928
by no means true romantic feelings.

12:20.928 --> 12:22.740
Even you know about this?

12:23.408 --> 12:27.120
I wanted to talk to her personally,

12:27.120 --> 12:28.568
but I always feel

12:28.568 --> 12:32.220
that some topics are hard
to bring up between siblings.

12:33.400 --> 12:34.688
During my absence,

12:34.688 --> 12:36.272
you must keep an eye on her for me.

12:36.272 --> 12:39.480
Don't let her be misled by Lord Gu.

12:39.480 --> 12:43.259
We have had many arguments over Lord Gu.

12:44.032 --> 12:47.399
She's currently avoiding me.

12:47.399 --> 12:50.639
You're always carefree and unrestrained,

12:50.639 --> 12:53.472
but when facing Zhi Li,
you're always cautious.

12:53.472 --> 12:54.720
You just treasure her too much,

12:54.720 --> 12:56.720
so you are overly cautious in action.

12:56.720 --> 13:00.639
When it comes to love, you need some courage.

13:00.639 --> 13:03.860
Otherwise, once you miss it,
you will regret it for life.

13:05.639 --> 13:10.200
Moreover, you are in your prime
and have a bright future.

13:10.200 --> 13:11.679
You're much better than Lord Gu.

13:11.679 --> 13:13.080
No matter what,

13:13.080 --> 13:15.399
you are over 20 years younger than him.

13:15.399 --> 13:17.879
I only accept you
as my future brother-in-law.

13:17.879 --> 13:19.200
I see.

13:19.200 --> 13:21.980
I will never give up on Zhi Li.

13:32.840 --> 13:34.440
- Father is cooking--
- Sweet and sour pork ribs.

13:34.440 --> 13:36.639
- Let's go.
- Don't push me.

13:36.639 --> 13:39.448
[Bofeng House]
His Majesty permitted Bofeng's reopening.

13:39.448 --> 13:41.720
We have delicious dishes for you.

13:41.720 --> 13:43.776
All drinks are half price.

13:43.776 --> 13:45.620
- Welcome!
- Good!

13:46.399 --> 13:48.019
Sir, please come in.

13:51.080 --> 13:52.639
The Blood Moon Society acts secretly.

13:52.639 --> 13:55.000
You must be extremely careful.

13:55.000 --> 13:57.820
If there is anything unusual,
send word back immediately.

13:58.919 --> 14:01.659
I'll act by imperial decree.
Don't worry, Your Majesty.

14:04.112 --> 14:06.320
Director Meng,
you even personally made pastries for me.

14:06.320 --> 14:08.899
It moves me so.

14:09.679 --> 14:11.539
Who said they are for you?

14:12.280 --> 14:14.320
I chatted with Director Meng last night

14:14.320 --> 14:16.159
and mentioned layer cakes.

14:16.159 --> 14:17.759
Last night?

14:17.759 --> 14:21.080
Last night,
I talked to Your Majesty about my trip,

14:21.080 --> 14:22.980
but I didn't see Director Meng there.

14:24.559 --> 14:25.840
Mr. Shen.

14:25.840 --> 14:27.360
Isn't Fu Zhi going to see you off?

14:27.360 --> 14:29.720
Zhi, I brought some silver and banknotes.

14:29.720 --> 14:32.320
- Zhi.
- And the withdrawal seals for money houses.

14:32.320 --> 14:35.039
Zhi, you are too good to me.

14:35.039 --> 14:36.919
We will have a long journey.

14:36.919 --> 14:38.639
We can't treat ourselves poorly.

14:38.639 --> 14:40.200
We?

14:40.200 --> 14:43.080
Zhi, I am going on a business trip.

14:43.080 --> 14:44.080
Guess what?

14:44.080 --> 14:46.080
His Majesty has permitted Bofeng House
to reopen,

14:46.080 --> 14:47.600
so merchants from various places
have sent invitations.

14:47.600 --> 14:50.000
The head of the Qingzhou Chamber of Commerce
has sent invitations three times.

14:50.000 --> 14:52.700
I have to go and inspect the place.

14:56.992 --> 15:00.320
Zhi, I'm going to carry out a secret mission.

15:00.320 --> 15:03.720
You can travel with Miss Yan
under the pretext of visiting relatives,

15:03.720 --> 15:05.759
which can serve as a cover.

15:05.759 --> 15:06.759
Great!

15:06.759 --> 15:09.120
Zhi, let's get a bigger carriage.

15:09.120 --> 15:11.480
We'll lay the fox fur blanket in it
and get your favorite pastries.

15:11.480 --> 15:13.559
Zhi, you are so thoughtful.

15:13.559 --> 15:15.279
Zhi, you are the best.

15:15.279 --> 15:18.559
No, you are the best.

15:18.559 --> 15:20.139
You are the best.

15:21.639 --> 15:23.379
What are you two doing?

15:24.159 --> 15:25.659
What are you doing?

15:28.016 --> 15:29.679
I am returning now.

15:29.679 --> 15:31.360
I can give you a ride.

15:31.360 --> 15:32.360
Let's go.

15:32.360 --> 15:34.320
I also need to return to the Censorate.

15:34.320 --> 15:36.200
- Let's go.
- Wait.

15:36.200 --> 15:37.360
The imperial palace and the Censorate

15:37.360 --> 15:39.940
are located in opposite directions.

15:41.440 --> 15:43.720
Zhi, let's go quickly. Take your sword.

15:43.720 --> 15:45.399
Meng, take care of yourself while I'm away.

15:45.399 --> 15:46.940
Remember to write to me.

15:47.800 --> 15:51.059
Zhi, when I return,
I will officially propose marriage to you.

15:53.679 --> 15:56.360
That day at the execution ground,
Gu Qin looked strange.

15:56.360 --> 15:57.940
He must have a guilty conscience.

15:58.600 --> 16:00.279
Tonight, I want to see

16:00.279 --> 16:01.960
whether the Maojing pendant is here or not.

16:01.960 --> 16:03.464
Mrs. Gu.

16:03.464 --> 16:05.519
We're here to seek the truth.

16:05.519 --> 16:07.200
I hope

16:07.200 --> 16:09.919
you will haunt the real murderer.

16:09.919 --> 16:13.120
Heaven and earth,

16:13.120 --> 16:14.648
ancestors protect us.

16:14.648 --> 16:18.312
- Don't panic when opening the coffin.
- Mrs. Gu, forgive us.

16:18.312 --> 16:19.840
Heaven--

16:19.840 --> 16:21.500
We're pressed for time.

16:50.519 --> 16:52.019
Forgive us.

16:58.080 --> 16:59.639
Someone is coming, Miss Meng.

16:59.639 --> 17:02.580
Just one last step to go. Search.

17:09.599 --> 17:11.099
Come on!

18:05.279 --> 18:07.299
My lord, it...

18:29.039 --> 18:32.279
Starting tomorrow,
send more monks to chant for my late wife

18:32.279 --> 18:34.299
throughout the day.

18:36.960 --> 18:40.160
Do not let any ghost disturb my late wife.

18:40.160 --> 18:41.660
Yes.

19:26.000 --> 19:27.279
[Library]
Your Majesty.

19:27.279 --> 19:30.359
Lord Gu claims that the Maojing pendant
was buried with his late wife,

19:30.359 --> 19:34.240
but Yin Qing and I opened the coffin
and couldn't find it.

19:34.240 --> 19:37.279
Even more suspicious,
he took people to check overnight,

19:37.279 --> 19:39.299
which shows he has a guilty conscience.

19:41.272 --> 19:43.440
Gu Qin acted
as if he deeply loved his late wife.

19:43.440 --> 19:45.099
Good acting.

19:47.272 --> 19:50.079
But now, even if we expose his lies,

19:50.079 --> 19:51.440
we have no solid evidence

19:51.440 --> 19:53.519
that he provided cover for Ling Yun Fei.

19:53.519 --> 19:55.528
Then we still cannot take him down.

19:55.528 --> 19:57.359
I have considered

19:57.359 --> 19:59.039
to confront him,

19:59.039 --> 20:01.920
but he can argue that the Maojing pendant
was stolen by tomb robbers.

20:01.920 --> 20:03.359
Then we can do nothing about it.

20:03.359 --> 20:05.839
Under the guise of cleaning house,

20:05.839 --> 20:07.920
on the surface,
I aim to supervise all officials.

20:07.920 --> 20:11.264
But in fact,
I want to find clues related to Gu Qin.

20:11.264 --> 20:14.672
What I want is not just to expose a lie,

20:14.672 --> 20:18.440
but to make sure no one in the court
dares to deceive me again.

20:18.440 --> 20:21.339
It's to kill two birds with one stone.

20:25.448 --> 20:26.980
What happened to your hand?

20:27.599 --> 20:30.000
Probably scratched myself
when opening the coffin.

20:30.000 --> 20:31.648
It's not serious.

20:31.648 --> 20:33.560
What did I give you the Light Cavalry for?

20:33.560 --> 20:35.264
Yin Qing alone can help me

20:35.264 --> 20:37.599
with small things like opening coffins.

20:37.599 --> 20:39.279
No need to trouble the Light Cavalry.

20:39.279 --> 20:40.632
Let me apply medicine for you.

20:40.632 --> 20:42.164
Your Majesty.

20:49.000 --> 20:50.440
Your Majesty.

20:50.440 --> 20:51.519
What is it?

20:51.519 --> 20:54.599
You're staying up late reading books again.

20:54.599 --> 20:56.000
It harms your health.

20:56.000 --> 20:58.240
I am truly worried about your body.

20:58.240 --> 21:02.140
So I specially made tonic soup for you.

21:12.096 --> 21:14.099
Your Majesty, what's wrong?

21:16.319 --> 21:19.240
I've been staying up late reading these days.

21:19.240 --> 21:20.799
I feel unwell,

21:20.799 --> 21:23.339
so I indeed need the tonic soup.

21:24.880 --> 21:26.380
Your Majesty.

21:41.464 --> 21:43.319
Your Majesty, you stay up late reading,

21:43.319 --> 21:44.720
which harms your health.

21:44.720 --> 21:46.240
After finishing the tonic soup

21:46.240 --> 21:48.079
that I specially prepared for you,

21:48.079 --> 21:50.040
please go to bed.

21:50.040 --> 21:51.696
You may leave now.

21:51.696 --> 21:53.240
I'll take my leave.

22:13.932 --> 22:15.872
Is he gone?

22:15.872 --> 22:18.079
You're always bold.

22:18.079 --> 22:19.400
Why were you afraid of him?

22:19.400 --> 22:23.359
Whenever I hear Chief Steward You's voice,
I feel inexplicably nervous.

22:23.359 --> 22:27.059
Didn't Your Majesty feel the same just now?

22:33.200 --> 22:35.480
I rarely see you like this.

22:35.480 --> 22:37.099
Stop laughing at me.

22:38.400 --> 22:40.200
I just opened a coffin,

22:40.200 --> 22:42.359
and now I have to hide behind bookshelves.

22:42.359 --> 22:45.539
I have to act secretly,
whether on personal affairs or not.

22:48.880 --> 22:51.359
Being with Your Majesty

22:51.359 --> 22:55.539
is even more nerve-wracking
than handling corrupt officials.

23:00.319 --> 23:02.160
You are afraid,

23:02.160 --> 23:03.660
but I like it.

23:31.400 --> 23:32.900
Director Meng.

23:34.359 --> 23:35.960
I have great news.

23:35.960 --> 23:37.559
Guess what?

23:37.559 --> 23:39.160
You seem so excited.

23:39.160 --> 23:41.240
It seems you got quite useful clues.

23:41.240 --> 23:42.319
Tell me.

23:42.319 --> 23:44.319
Li Xin, the Vice Minister of Revenue,
embezzled money

23:44.319 --> 23:46.400
and gave all his ill-gotten wealth
to his wife to manage.

23:46.400 --> 23:48.079
But his wife keeps several young lovers

23:48.079 --> 23:51.079
behind his back.

23:51.079 --> 23:53.279
I can give my only ill-gotten house

23:53.279 --> 23:54.720
to the Censorate right now.

23:54.720 --> 23:56.319
You can see there is nothing expensive here.

23:56.319 --> 23:58.920
I never hide illicit money here.

23:58.920 --> 24:01.319
Mr. Yin, I...

24:01.319 --> 24:03.119
- Honey.
- You witch!

24:03.119 --> 24:04.424
- Honey.
- How dare you spend my money

24:04.424 --> 24:05.559
on your darn lovers!

24:05.559 --> 24:07.559
Mr. Li, it's not my fault.

24:07.559 --> 24:09.519
You're a kept man!

24:09.519 --> 24:10.640
It's more than that.

24:10.640 --> 24:14.160
The wife of Mr. Zhang of Ministry of Justice
came here to personally report

24:14.160 --> 24:16.920
that her husband keeps 12 mistresses.

24:16.920 --> 24:18.440
I heard more than half of the 12 mistresses

24:18.440 --> 24:20.680
are from Wanxiang Pavilion.

24:20.680 --> 24:23.119
Liu Ru Yan sent them to Mr. Zhang.

24:23.119 --> 24:24.680
They only care about money, not the person,

24:24.680 --> 24:26.279
and get along like real sisters.

24:26.279 --> 24:29.119
As long as they get enough money,
they won't be jealous at all.

24:29.119 --> 24:31.880
And Chen Jing Yi, the compiler in Hanlin.

24:31.880 --> 24:34.119
She is well-read and gentle.

24:34.119 --> 24:36.920
She is praised by the old ministers.

24:36.920 --> 24:39.720
How could she be involved in such scandals?

24:39.720 --> 24:43.599
I am nearly 70.
How could I do such a filthy thing?

24:43.599 --> 24:46.579
This is a smear!

24:53.680 --> 24:55.599
Don't be afraid.

24:55.599 --> 24:58.420
If you don't speak out bravely,
you won't have a chance again.

25:00.400 --> 25:02.940
Don't be afraid. Speak out bravely.

25:07.039 --> 25:08.480
It was you

25:08.480 --> 25:11.440
who used your position to harass me.

25:11.440 --> 25:14.839
You also threatened my career
to keep me silent.

25:14.839 --> 25:18.220
Otherwise, I'll have no place in the capital.

25:19.359 --> 25:22.624
I believe some of the female officials

25:22.624 --> 25:25.592
were also once persecuted by Mr. Jiang.

25:25.592 --> 25:27.900
Do you dare to stand up with me?

25:38.680 --> 25:40.660
If everyone remains silent,

25:41.512 --> 25:44.720
these hypocrites will go unpunished.

25:44.720 --> 25:48.920
In the future, more women will suffer.

25:48.920 --> 25:52.839
As female officials,
we already face many difficulties.

25:52.839 --> 25:55.579
We must stop this kind of misconduct.

25:56.519 --> 25:57.519
It was you

25:57.519 --> 26:00.640
who used your position to harass me.

26:00.640 --> 26:01.920
Yes, it was you.

26:01.920 --> 26:03.000
You also harassed me.

26:03.000 --> 26:04.599
It was you who harassed me.

26:04.599 --> 26:06.400
Take him away.

26:06.400 --> 26:07.400
Why are you arresting me?

26:07.400 --> 26:09.240
- Go.
- Why are you arresting me?

26:09.240 --> 26:12.720
We also discovered
the Ministry of Personnel sold positions.

26:12.720 --> 26:13.960
But for now,

26:13.960 --> 26:16.079
some minor officials are behind it.

26:16.079 --> 26:18.220
High officials are not involved yet.

26:23.720 --> 26:25.599
All of you are involved
in selling official positions.

26:25.599 --> 26:27.240
You're to be suspended and investigated.

26:27.240 --> 26:28.759
Take them away.

26:28.759 --> 26:30.240
What's going on?

26:30.240 --> 26:31.559
Go.

26:31.559 --> 26:32.559
- Go.
- Why are you arresting me?

26:32.559 --> 26:33.840
Move!

26:33.840 --> 26:36.920
Right now,
we've only caught a few small fish,

26:36.920 --> 26:41.960
but the giant one behind Ling Yun Fei
is still lurking underwater.

26:41.960 --> 26:45.900
We must stir up the water.

26:46.880 --> 26:50.259
It's easy to catch the fish
from the muddy water.

26:53.720 --> 26:57.839
On behalf of all ministers,

26:57.839 --> 27:00.000
I impeach Meng Ting Hui of the Censorate

27:00.000 --> 27:01.519
for exceeding her authority

27:01.519 --> 27:04.640
and invading the privacy of high officials.

27:04.640 --> 27:07.440
It's caused complaints throughout the court

27:07.440 --> 27:09.220
and made everyone uneasy.

27:10.119 --> 27:13.200
It's rare to see you all so united.

27:13.200 --> 27:14.680
I am very pleased.

27:14.680 --> 27:17.200
Since the Censorate acts so arrogantly,

27:17.200 --> 27:19.519
you can directly report their negligence

27:19.519 --> 27:22.920
and expose their illegal acts.

27:22.920 --> 27:24.980
I will show them no mercy.

27:31.359 --> 27:33.779
Do you have anything else to report?

27:43.759 --> 27:46.380
Don't go yet, everyone.

27:48.640 --> 27:50.740
The tea in the Censorate is getting cold.

27:51.839 --> 27:53.119
Please come with me.

27:53.119 --> 27:54.960
We haven't broken any law.

27:54.960 --> 27:56.480
How can you detain us arbitrarily?

27:56.480 --> 27:58.559
- That's right.
- Yes, why are you arresting us?

27:58.559 --> 28:01.359
Because you fabricated charges

28:01.359 --> 28:03.039
and maliciously impeached the Censorate.

28:03.039 --> 28:06.200
I can detain you for 24 hours
on the charge of false accusation.

28:06.200 --> 28:07.960
- Take them away.
- Yes.

28:07.960 --> 28:10.779
Your Majesty!

28:12.359 --> 28:14.119
Your Majesty, we're innocent!

28:14.119 --> 28:15.619
Your Majesty!

28:16.240 --> 28:17.712
Meng Ting Hui just lied!

28:17.712 --> 28:19.759
- She is framing loyal officials!
- Your Majesty!

28:19.759 --> 28:21.272
Move!

28:21.272 --> 28:22.272
Move!

28:22.272 --> 28:23.519
[Censorate]

28:23.519 --> 28:24.680
Meng Ting Hui.

28:24.680 --> 28:27.279
What gives you the right to detain us here?

28:27.279 --> 28:29.279
- Right.
- Yes, why?

28:29.279 --> 28:31.359
Why are you detaining us here?

28:31.359 --> 28:32.519
You evil woman.

28:32.519 --> 28:34.200
Unless you kill me,

28:34.200 --> 28:36.319
I will submit memorials every day

28:36.319 --> 28:37.759
to impeach you, you evil woman.

28:37.759 --> 28:40.079
- Yes, that's right.
- Yes.

28:40.079 --> 28:42.880
You are the bane of this country,

28:42.880 --> 28:44.359
you evil woman.

28:44.359 --> 28:46.519
Yes, you're the bane of this country.

28:46.519 --> 28:47.559
You're the bane.

28:47.559 --> 28:49.880
You evil woman, get out of the court.

28:49.880 --> 28:52.140
I disdain to work with you.

29:00.592 --> 29:03.056
I just invited all of you over

29:03.056 --> 29:05.619
to have a cup of tea here.

29:06.519 --> 29:08.680
Why are you so agitated?

29:08.680 --> 29:12.519
We will not drink tea
from a bad official like you.

29:12.519 --> 29:13.759
- That's right.
- Yes.

29:13.759 --> 29:15.319
We will not drink your tea.

29:15.319 --> 29:17.792
You evil woman, get out of the court.

29:17.792 --> 29:19.559
- Get out.
- During last year's exam,

29:19.559 --> 29:22.559
Academician Lin took bribes from candidates

29:22.559 --> 29:24.920
and altered 13 exam papers.

29:24.920 --> 29:28.000
Three of the candidates were illiterate,

29:28.000 --> 29:31.000
while those who studied hard failed.

29:31.000 --> 29:32.680
Someone vomited blood
and fainted on the spot.

29:32.680 --> 29:34.920
Send him to the Supreme Court

29:34.920 --> 29:36.200
and punish him by law.

29:36.200 --> 29:38.880
Meng Ting Hui, this is personal revenge.

29:38.880 --> 29:40.119
Yin Qing.

29:40.119 --> 29:42.079
- I want to see His Majesty.
- Director Meng.

29:42.079 --> 29:43.960
- Meng Ting Hui!
- There was heavy rain earlier this year.

29:43.960 --> 29:48.359
Pan Wen Hai, the Minister of Works,
under the pretext of repairing the dam,

29:48.359 --> 29:50.880
embezzled nearly 100,000 taels
of disaster relief funds,

29:50.880 --> 29:52.519
destroying six villages downstream,

29:52.519 --> 29:54.400
with countless casualties,

29:54.400 --> 29:57.319
yet only three days after the disaster,

29:57.319 --> 29:59.759
he bought 1,000 mu of fertile land.

29:59.759 --> 30:01.920
1,000 mu?

30:01.920 --> 30:04.160
Utter nonsense! That's a lie!

30:04.160 --> 30:06.099
This is the evidence of his embezzlement.

30:12.528 --> 30:14.799
- You--
- How dare you embezzle the relief funds!

30:14.799 --> 30:17.039
Send him and the evidence
to the Ministry of Justice.

30:17.039 --> 30:19.160
Remember to remind the Minister of Justice

30:19.160 --> 30:23.279
that this is a felony crime
according to the Laws of Ning Empire.

30:23.279 --> 30:24.559
I'm innocent!

30:24.559 --> 30:25.960
Nonsense!

30:25.960 --> 30:27.400
Utter nonsense!

30:27.400 --> 30:28.900
Mr. Pan!

30:32.039 --> 30:33.640
Next.

30:33.640 --> 30:35.359
Meng Ting Hui!

30:35.359 --> 30:37.160
You're doing this for private gain.

30:37.160 --> 30:38.680
It's to get rid of dissidents.

30:38.680 --> 30:40.319
His Majesty is out of his mind.

30:40.319 --> 30:42.200
He actually favors only you.

30:42.200 --> 30:43.440
Hear, hear!

30:43.440 --> 30:45.319
- You evil woman!
- Why?

30:45.319 --> 30:46.819
Shut up!

31:16.160 --> 31:19.640
How dare you
speak recklessly of His Majesty's decisions?

31:19.640 --> 31:23.420
Lord Gu, it's an honor to have you here.

31:24.039 --> 31:25.539
Sorry for not greeting you properly.

31:28.599 --> 31:31.160
They say the tea here tastes terrible,

31:31.160 --> 31:33.180
but I want to try it.

31:34.640 --> 31:36.164
Director Meng.

31:37.232 --> 31:39.500
Would you offer me a cup of tea?

31:48.319 --> 31:51.099
Your tea, please.

31:55.440 --> 31:57.440
[Salary Records]
The Censorate has been fighting corruption.

31:57.440 --> 31:59.640
As the head of all officials,

31:59.640 --> 32:02.240
praised as a virtuous chancellor,

32:02.240 --> 32:04.240
I should set an example
for the court officials

32:04.240 --> 32:06.099
and actively cooperate
with the investigation.

32:08.000 --> 32:09.319
Lord Gu,

32:09.319 --> 32:12.839
I heard that Pan Wen Hai
and Academician Lin were both your students.

32:12.839 --> 32:14.539
Director Meng, mind your words.

32:16.880 --> 32:19.039
We are all court officials.

32:19.039 --> 32:22.039
We serve His Majesty
and are only loyal to His Majesty.

32:22.039 --> 32:25.799
If close associates of mine violate the law,

32:25.799 --> 32:27.700
I will show them no mercy.

32:29.200 --> 32:31.759
You're quite sensible, Lord Gu.

32:31.759 --> 32:33.839
Speaking of close associates,

32:33.839 --> 32:36.420
do you have any relatives?

32:38.279 --> 32:40.040
I come from a humble family.

32:40.040 --> 32:42.759
I'm the only son in my family,
placed with high hopes.

32:42.759 --> 32:44.440
Director Meng,
you can investigate me as you wish.

32:44.440 --> 32:47.200
Please enforce the law impartially

32:47.200 --> 32:48.319
and act based on the truth.

32:48.319 --> 32:51.039
I am willing to take this chance

32:51.039 --> 32:52.160
to prove my integrity.

32:52.160 --> 32:56.440
Lord Gu, are you really not worried
we might find something?

32:56.440 --> 32:58.680
I act properly.

32:58.680 --> 33:00.279
I'm not afraid of your investigation.

33:00.279 --> 33:02.859
Here are my salary records for these years.

33:03.839 --> 33:05.339
You may look at them.

33:06.200 --> 33:09.119
Since you're so frank,

33:09.119 --> 33:11.359
you must be innocent.

33:11.359 --> 33:14.779
We naturally do not need
to spend too much time on you.

33:15.400 --> 33:18.200
In the past, you helped me in my career.

33:18.200 --> 33:19.920
I deeply believe

33:19.920 --> 33:21.579
you're upright and honest.

33:22.519 --> 33:24.019
Please.

33:34.759 --> 33:37.440
Who says the tea here is not good?

33:37.440 --> 33:39.579
I find it quite delicious.

33:41.000 --> 33:43.319
All of you, please calm down.

33:43.319 --> 33:45.480
Let's taste this tea together.

33:45.480 --> 33:47.140
As colleagues,

33:47.799 --> 33:50.200
we should fully cooperate with Director Meng.

33:50.200 --> 33:51.900
Yes.

33:56.680 --> 33:59.000
<i>Meng Ting Hui is out of her mind.</i>

33:59.000 --> 34:01.480
<i>She has thrown the six ministries into chaos.</i>

34:01.480 --> 34:04.720
Pan Wen Hai and Academician Lin
are already restless.

34:04.720 --> 34:06.000
If the investigation continues like this--

34:06.000 --> 34:08.480
Since Meng Ting Hui wants
to fight corruption,

34:08.480 --> 34:11.019
I naturally have to cooperate.

34:15.000 --> 34:16.928
Perhaps

34:16.928 --> 34:18.780
we should leak out something.

34:21.719 --> 34:24.800
Lord Gu, they are loyal to you.

34:24.800 --> 34:26.480
Since they've set their fishing net,

34:26.480 --> 34:28.840
we have to release some small fish.

34:28.840 --> 34:31.940
Mr. Pan loves to buy land and houses,
doesn't he?

34:33.800 --> 34:36.039
Have someone leak this to Meng Ting Hui.

34:36.039 --> 34:38.019
As for how much she can dig up,

34:39.519 --> 34:41.699
that depends on her ability.

34:49.440 --> 34:53.000
Lord Gu, thank you for your full support

34:53.000 --> 34:55.300
for our work.

34:56.800 --> 34:59.280
Well, I will take my leave.

34:59.280 --> 35:01.239
If you encounter any difficulties,

35:01.239 --> 35:04.300
please have someone inform me.

35:05.280 --> 35:07.980
Director Meng, I will see my teacher off.

35:13.239 --> 35:16.800
Director, he clearly came prepared.

35:16.800 --> 35:18.199
How should we respond?

35:18.199 --> 35:21.400
The more he acts like this,
the more guilty he is.

35:21.400 --> 35:23.559
Since he wants to put on this show,

35:23.559 --> 35:25.440
we might as well play along.

35:25.440 --> 35:28.928
Go and compile all the files related to him.

35:28.928 --> 35:32.960
This old fox wants to use me
to show his honesty and integrity.

35:32.960 --> 35:35.320
I want to see

35:35.320 --> 35:37.920
whether he is truly honest

35:37.920 --> 35:40.539
or hypocritical, with blood on his hands.

36:50.480 --> 36:52.119
Blood moon in the sky!

36:52.119 --> 36:53.920
The Black Bird returns!

36:53.920 --> 36:55.599
Blood moon in the sky!

36:55.599 --> 36:57.539
The Black Bird returns!

36:59.280 --> 37:01.079
A secret letter from Mr. Shangguan.

37:01.079 --> 37:03.719
Although we failed to take Ying Gua's life,

37:03.719 --> 37:05.440
the princess has gained trust

37:05.440 --> 37:06.639
and got promoted.

37:06.639 --> 37:08.119
Heaven bless Zhongwan!

37:08.119 --> 37:10.000
May we restore our land!

37:10.000 --> 37:13.280
Ying Gua rejected a marriage alliance
with Beijian.

37:13.280 --> 37:16.840
Our Xuanyu Guards have snatched
30,000 dan of grain from the Ning Empire.

37:16.840 --> 37:18.840
It is a heaven-sent opportunity.

37:18.840 --> 37:23.579
In three days,
I'll go to Beijian to forge an alliance.

37:26.679 --> 37:30.039
By our sharp sword,

37:30.039 --> 37:33.280
the Ning Empire will change hands.

37:33.280 --> 37:34.960
Heaven bless Zhongwan!

37:34.960 --> 37:36.599
May we restore our land!

37:36.599 --> 37:38.119
Heaven bless Zhongwan!

37:38.119 --> 37:39.599
May we restore our land!

37:39.599 --> 37:43.764
[Censorate]

38:03.456 --> 38:07.412
[Beijian wants a marriage alliance,
but I don't want it. What I want is only you]

38:51.719 --> 38:54.480
Yao, come and catch me!

38:54.480 --> 38:56.599
Come on!

38:56.599 --> 38:59.000
Yao, come on.

38:59.000 --> 39:01.079
Shangguan.

39:01.079 --> 39:03.159
Shangguan.

39:03.159 --> 39:05.800
Shangguan.

39:05.800 --> 39:07.940
Shangguan.

39:09.000 --> 39:11.400
Shangguan.

39:11.400 --> 39:13.639
Where are you?

39:13.639 --> 39:16.280
Shangguan.

39:16.280 --> 39:18.639
Shangguan.

39:18.639 --> 39:21.519
Shangguan.

39:21.519 --> 39:24.239
Shangguan.

39:24.239 --> 39:26.099
Shangguan.

39:27.079 --> 39:28.980
Shangguan.

39:32.559 --> 39:34.780
Shangguan.

40:19.440 --> 40:20.940
Le Yan.

40:25.159 --> 40:27.539
Master, I've finished.

40:32.320 --> 40:33.599
Excellent brushwork,

40:33.599 --> 40:35.344
but...

40:35.344 --> 40:36.860
It lacks a finishing touch.

40:50.686 --> 40:53.524
[Belated Spring]

41:01.880 --> 41:03.920
Belated Spring.

41:03.920 --> 41:06.120
At night, news of spring arrived.

41:06.120 --> 41:07.640
It got me in the mood.

41:07.640 --> 41:09.424
I secretly expressed my longing for love.

41:09.424 --> 41:11.480
Only spring knew about my love.

41:11.480 --> 41:13.139
This is Belated Spring.

41:14.159 --> 41:15.920
Since Ling Yi passed away,

41:15.920 --> 41:18.960
I've been feeling uneasy.

41:18.960 --> 41:20.519
The winter is long,

41:20.519 --> 41:22.400
and spring is far out of reach.

41:22.400 --> 41:25.559
But that day,
when I put down the dagger in front of you,

41:25.559 --> 41:27.300
I suddenly realized

41:27.984 --> 41:29.840
the dead are gone,

41:29.840 --> 41:32.940
but the living should live for themselves.

41:36.039 --> 41:39.800
Le Yan, you made me live again.

41:39.800 --> 41:43.059
In the future,
I want to live for myself once more.

41:44.672 --> 41:47.159
It's wonderful that you think this way.

41:47.159 --> 41:50.559
The other day, you were deeply sorrowful,

41:50.559 --> 41:53.400
yet you still managed to assist Director Meng
in fighting corruption.

41:53.400 --> 41:57.079
I admire you deeply,
and I also worry about you.

41:57.079 --> 42:01.059
So I painted this spring scene for you.

42:07.880 --> 42:10.699
Le Yan, all of this is because of you.

42:11.320 --> 42:14.900
Only by your side can I be my true self.

42:15.800 --> 42:17.960
A romantic relationship is forbidden
between teachers and students.

42:17.960 --> 42:20.179
It's going to be a tough road.

42:21.960 --> 42:23.880
But if I persevere,

42:23.880 --> 42:25.528
Le Yan,

42:25.528 --> 42:29.059
will you be brave for me, just this once?
